    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d165">

                <pb facs="0251" n="147" xml:id="pg147"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/3801b: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Great Britain (Atherton)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-01-31T17:00:00-05:00">January 31, 1932—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. Inform Prime Minister immediately that I have taken up with the President the
                    matter discussed between him and me by telephone this morning and last evening.
                    We feel that for the moment the project should be postponed. I shall probably
                    later renew conference with regard to it.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
